      "symbol": "TestJpeg.test_a_zero_length_segment_is_not_left_behind",
      "line": 240,
      "offset": 1,
      "text": "Emptying rather than removing would still tell a reader the file once\ncarried EXIF; the segment must be gone entirely.",
